{"version":2,"slug":"english-speaking-practice-real-life-role-play-b2-listening","videoId":"F5xVDGW_Jx4","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/F5xVDGW_Jx4","lang":"en","title":"English Speaking Practice | Real-Life Role Play (B2 Listening)","category":"Daily life","channel":"Miss Honey 🍯","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@Slow_English_Podcast","captionSource":"auto","tags":["English Conversation","learn english"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"This isn't a vocabulary lesson."},{"start":4,"text":"This isn't a grammar lesson."},{"start":8,"text":"Today,"},{"start":9,"text":"you're going to practice English"},{"start":13,"text":"the way you actually use it. Imagine you"},{"start":18,"text":"finally booked that trip that you've"},{"start":22,"text":"always dreamed of. Maybe you're visiting"},{"start":27,"text":"another country."},{"start":29,"text":"Maybe you're moving abroad. Maybe you're"},{"start":33,"text":"finally taking that vacation that you've"},{"start":37,"text":"been dreaming about. Whatever your dream"},{"start":41,"text":"is,"},{"start":42,"text":"English will help you experience it."},{"start":47,"text":"Throughout this video,"},{"start":49,"text":"you'll experience some of the most"},{"start":54,"text":"common conversations"},{"start":56,"text":"that you'll have while traveling."},{"start":60,"text":"We'll check in at the airports."},{"start":64,"text":"We'll go through security."},{"start":68,"text":"We'll take a taxi."},{"start":70,"text":"We'll check in to our hotel. We'll meet"},{"start":74,"text":"new people."},{"start":76,"text":"We'll order food, [snorts]"},{"start":78,"text":"ask for directions,"},{"start":81,"text":"make plans,"},{"start":84,"text":"and even have some small talk along the"},{"start":87,"text":"way."},{"start":88,"text":"We'll do it slowly first."},{"start":92,"text":"And once you feel comfortable enough,"},{"start":97,"text":"we'll do it again at a normal pace. We"},{"start":102,"text":"will practice real English."},{"start":106,"text":"Slow English is good to start with,"},{"start":110,"text":"but I want you guys to be able to"},{"start":113,"text":"understand English at a normal pace."},{"start":118,"text":"Eventually."},{"start":120,"text":"So,"},{"start":121,"text":"you're red,"},{"start":123,"text":"[gasps]"},{"start":123.6,"text":"I'm blue. I could be a flight attendant,"},{"start":127,"text":"a waitress,"},{"start":129,"text":"or just a person that you meet while"},{"start":132,"text":"traveling."},{"start":134,"text":"We'll try out different scenarios that"},{"start":138,"text":"you'll probably be in if you're going to"},{"start":142,"text":"travel. And don't worry if you're not"},{"start":146,"text":"perfect. The goal is to become"},{"start":150,"text":"comfortable"},{"start":151,"text":"speaking English in real situations."},{"start":156,"text":"Ready?"},{"start":158,"text":"Let's catch our flight. So, remember,"},{"start":162,"text":"answer slowly first, and then repeat it"},{"start":168,"text":"at a normal pace. Good morning."},{"start":171,"text":"Where are you flying today?"},{"start":180,"text":"Perfect."},{"start":181,"text":"May I see your passport, please?"},{"start":188,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":189,"text":"Are you checking any bags today?"},{"start":197,"text":"Great."},{"start":199,"text":"Could you put your suitcase on the scale"},{"start":203,"text":"for me?"},{"start":207,"text":"Perfect. Here's your boarding pass."},{"start":210,"text":"Your flight leaves at"},{"start":615,"text":"a.m."},{"start":615.6,"text":"And your boarding gate is B12."},{"start":616.2,"text":"Have a wonderful trip. Airport security."},{"start":616.8,"text":"Good morning."},{"start":617.4,"text":"Boarding pass and passport, please."},{"start":618,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":618.6,"text":"Place your backpack on the belt, please."},{"start":619.2,"text":"Any liquids or electronics?"},{"start":619.8,"text":"Okay. Put them on the tray."},{"start":620.4,"text":"Perfect."},{"start":621,"text":"Please walk through the scanner."},{"start":621.6,"text":"You're all set."},{"start":622.2,"text":"Enjoy your flight."},{"start":622.8,"text":"Now, a taxi or Uber drive to the hotel."},{"start":623.4,"text":"Hey there."},{"start":624,"text":"Where are you headed?"},{"start":624.6,"text":"Okay."},{"start":625.2,"text":"Where are you from?"},{"start":625.8,"text":"I hear that."},{"start":626.4,"text":"I hate flying."},{"start":627,"text":"But, you'll have a great time in the"},{"start":627.6,"text":"city."},{"start":628.2,"text":"Do you know what you're doing yet?"},{"start":628.8,"text":"But, how long are you staying for?"},{"start":629.4,"text":"Nice."},{"start":630,"text":"That's a good amount."},{"start":630.6,"text":"If you have time,"},{"start":631.2,"text":"you should see"},{"start":631.8,"text":"the old city."},{"start":632.4,"text":"It's beautiful."},{"start":633,"text":"Okay."},{"start":633.6,"text":"We're here."},{"start":634.2,"text":"It's that building with the two red"},{"start":634.8,"text":"doors."},{"start":635.4,"text":"That'll be $23, please."},{"start":636,"text":"You got it."},{"start":636.6,"text":"Have a nice day."},{"start":637.2,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":637.8,"text":"Now, at the hotel."},{"start":638.4,"text":"Hello. Welcome."},{"start":639,"text":"How can I help you?"},{"start":639.6,"text":"Of course."},{"start":640.2,"text":"What's the name on the reservation?"},{"start":640.8,"text":"Perfect."},{"start":641.4,"text":"You're staying for four nights, right?"},{"start":642,"text":"Wonderful."},{"start":642.6,"text":"Breakfast is from"},{"start":643.2,"text":"to"},{"start":643.8,"text":"."},{"start":644.4,"text":"And the Wi-Fi password is on the back of"},{"start":645,"text":"your room key."},{"start":645.6,"text":"There's a common area"},{"start":646.2,"text":"you can use from"},{"start":646.8,"text":"to"},{"start":647.4,"text":"p.m."},{"start":648,"text":"Any questions?"},{"start":648.6,"text":"Check-out is at"},{"start":660,"text":"a.m."},{"start":660.6,"text":"You got it."},{"start":661.2,"text":"Let me show you to your room."},{"start":661.8,"text":"Do you need any help with your bags?"},{"start":662.4,"text":"Of course."},{"start":663,"text":"Now,"},{"start":663.6,"text":"asking for directions."},{"start":664.2,"text":"Yeah, of course."},{"start":664.8,"text":"You can either take the subway"},{"start":665.4,"text":"or the bus."},{"start":666,"text":"The subway is just around the corner."},{"start":666.6,"text":"You can take line three"},{"start":667.2,"text":"and get off after"},{"start":667.8,"text":"two stations south."},{"start":668.4,"text":"It's about a 10-minute walk from there."},{"start":669,"text":"So, just go straight and then turn left"},{"start":669.6,"text":"at the hospital."},{"start":670.2,"text":"Mhm."},{"start":670.8,"text":"It depends on how much you're willing to"},{"start":671.4,"text":"walk."},{"start":672,"text":"It's about"},{"start":672.6,"text":"a 50-minute walk."},{"start":673.2,"text":"You're very welcome."},{"start":673.8,"text":"Have a great day."},{"start":674.4,"text":"Our next scene at the coffee shop."},{"start":675,"text":"Hi."},{"start":675.6,"text":"What can I get started for you?"},{"start":676.2,"text":"What size?"},{"start":676.8,"text":"Anything else?"},{"start":677.4,"text":"Okay."},{"start":678,"text":"That'll be 8.50."},{"start":678.6,"text":"Card or cash?"},{"start":679.2,"text":"Okay."},{"start":679.8,"text":"You can insert your card when the screen"},{"start":680.4,"text":"lights up."},{"start":681,"text":"Okay. All set. I'll call you when your"},{"start":681.6,"text":"order is ready."},{"start":682.2,"text":"Now,"},{"start":682.8,"text":"meeting someone."},{"start":683.4,"text":"No, no, no. Go ahead."},{"start":684,"text":"Nice to meet you."},{"start":684.6,"text":"I'm Ty."},{"start":685.2,"text":"Oh. Thanks."},{"start":685.8,"text":"Um I think it means flower."},{"start":686.4,"text":"But I'm not completely sure."},{"start":687,"text":"I just got here on Tuesday."},{"start":687.6,"text":"So, it's only been a couple days."},{"start":688.2,"text":"What about you?"},{"start":688.8,"text":"I've always wanted to visit this city."},{"start":689.4,"text":"The food,"},{"start":690,"text":"the people, the culture."},{"start":690.6,"text":"I feel like I really connect with it. I"},{"start":691.2,"text":"was nervous at first, too."},{"start":691.8,"text":"But, don't worry."},{"start":692.4,"text":"I'm sure you'll feel much more"},{"start":693,"text":"comfortable by tomorrow."},{"start":693.6,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":694.2,"text":"It's so different from my home country,"},{"start":694.8,"text":"as well."},{"start":695.4,"text":"Where are you from?"},{"start":696,"text":"Mhm."},{"start":696.6,"text":"I'm from the US, but I've lived my whole"},{"start":697.2,"text":"life in Mexico."},{"start":697.8,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":698.4,"text":"If you do, I can give you some really"},{"start":699,"text":"good recommendations."},{"start":699.6,"text":"Mhm."},{"start":700.2,"text":"I'm probably going to check out a couple"},{"start":700.8,"text":"temples"},{"start":701.4,"text":"and maybe try these restaurants that I"},{"start":702,"text":"passed by"},{"start":702.6,"text":"earlier this morning."},{"start":703.2,"text":"That's always a good plan."},{"start":703.8,"text":"Do you want to check out the temples"},{"start":704.4,"text":"with me later?"},{"start":705,"text":"I'm heading out in about 30 minutes."},{"start":705.6,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":706.2,"text":"Let's meet in reception"},{"start":706.8,"text":"in 30 minutes."},{"start":707.4,"text":"I'll see you there."},{"start":708,"text":"Very good."},{"start":708.6,"text":"[laughter]"},{"start":709.2,"text":"Now at the restaurant ordering food."},{"start":711,"text":"Good evening."},{"start":712,"text":"Table for one?"},{"start":717,"text":"Perfect. Right this way."},{"start":721,"text":"Can I get you something to drink while"},{"start":724,"text":"you wait?"},{"start":728,"text":"Great."},{"start":729,"text":"Are you ready to order?"},{"start":735,"text":"Excellent."},{"start":736,"text":"I'll have that right out for you."},{"start":742,"text":"How is everything?"},{"start":747,"text":"I'm glad you're enjoying it."},{"start":749,"text":"Would you like anything else?"},{"start":755,"text":"All right."},{"start":756,"text":"Whenever you're ready, I can bring the"},{"start":759,"text":"check."},{"start":763,"text":"Of course."},{"start":765,"text":"Cash or credit?"},{"start":769,"text":"You got it."},{"start":771,"text":"If you're liking this video,"},{"start":773,"text":"be sure to like it so that I can focus"},{"start":777,"text":"on making more videos like these. And"},{"start":780,"text":"subscribe to learn English with me every"},{"start":784,"text":"Wednesday."},{"start":786,"text":"Now, let's make some plans. Hey."},{"start":790,"text":"I'm thinking about going to the beach"},{"start":792,"text":"tomorrow."},{"start":793,"text":"Want to come?"},{"start":799,"text":"Cool."},{"start":801,"text":"What time works for you?"},{"start":808,"text":"Perfect."},{"start":809,"text":"Let's meet at reception."},{"start":814,"text":"Okay, cool."},{"start":815,"text":"See you tomorrow."},{"start":820,"text":"Me too."},{"start":822,"text":"Now, let's go at a normal pace."},{"start":826,"text":"You got this."},{"start":828,"text":"If you're not ready yet,"},{"start":829,"text":"then just repeat it slowly"},{"start":832,"text":"until you are."},{"start":835,"text":"Airport check-in."},{"start":837,"text":"Good morning. Where are you flying"},{"start":838,"text":"today?"},{"start":842,"text":"Perfect. May I see your passport,"},{"start":844,"text":"please?"},{"start":847,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":848,"text":"Are you checking any bags today?"},{"start":853,"text":"Great."},{"start":854,"text":"Could you put your suitcase on the scale"},{"start":855,"text":"for me?"},{"start":858,"text":"Perfect."},{"start":860,"text":"Here's your boarding pass