server."},{"start":1218,"text":"Good evening. Table for one?"},{"start":1222,"text":"Right this way, please."},{"start":1223,"text":"Here's the menu."},{"start":1225,"text":"Can I get you something to drink while"},{"start":1226,"text":"you wait?"},{"start":1230,"text":"Okay."},{"start":1231,"text":"Are you ready to order?"},{"start":1235,"text":"Excellent."},{"start":1236,"text":"I'll have that right out for you."},{"start":1241,"text":"How is everything?"},{"start":1245,"text":"Great. I'm glad you're enjoying it."},{"start":1247,"text":"Would you like anything else?"},{"start":1251,"text":"Of course."},{"start":1252,"text":"Whenever you're ready, I can bring the"},{"start":1253,"text":"check."},{"start":1257,"text":"Of course."},{"start":1258,"text":"And now, let's make some plans."},{"start":1260,"text":"Hey."},{"start":1261,"text":"I was thinking of going to the beach"},{"start":1262,"text":"tomorrow. Want to come?"},{"start":1268,"text":"Cool."},{"start":1269,"text":"What time works for you?"},{"start":1273,"text":"Yeah, perfect. Let's meet at reception."},{"start":1279,"text":"All right, see you tomorrow."},{"start":1283,"text":"Yay!"},{"start":1285,"text":"So, you made it through an entire day"},{"start":1289,"text":"using English."},{"start":1291,"text":"If you answered out loud, you just"},{"start":1293,"text":"practiced dozens of real English"},{"start":1297,"text":"conversations"},{"start":1298,"text":"that you'll definitely use while"},{"start":1301,"text":"traveling."},{"start":1302,"text":"Remember,"},{"start":1304,"text":"confidence doesn't come before speaking,"},{"start":1308,"text":"confidence comes with speaking. The more"},{"start":1313,"text":"you practice, the more natural it will"},{"start":1316,"text":"feel."},{"start":1317,"text":"And this is just the beginning of my"},{"start":1320,"text":"English role-play series,"},{"start":1323,"text":"so you can practice real English"},{"start":1326,"text":"conversations and be ready to speak"},{"start":1329,"text":"English in real life."},{"start":1331,"text":"So, how did you do? Let me know in the"},{"start":1333,"text":"comments. What were some expressions"},{"start":1336,"text":"that maybe were new to you, or you had"},{"start":1339,"text":"to look up?"},{"start":1341,"text":"And don't worry if you didn't catch"},{"start":1343,"text":"every word."},{"start":1345,"text":"That's completely normal. The goal isn't"},{"start":1348,"text":"to understand everything the first time."},{"start":1352,"text":"The goal is to become a little more"},{"start":1354,"text":"comfortable"},{"start":1356,"text":"each time you listen."},{"start":1359,"text":"So, here's your challenge."},{"start":1361,"text":"Go back to the beginning"},{"start":1364,"text":"and listen again."},{"start":1366,"text":"I promise, you'll understand even more"},{"start":1370,"text":"the second time."},{"start":1372,"text":"If you enjoyed this style of video,"},{"start":1376,"text":"let me know in the comments."},{"start":1378,"text":"I can make more real-life conversations"},{"start":1382,"text":"for airports, hotels,"},{"start":1385,"text":"shopping,"},{"start":1386,"text":"job interviews,"},{"start":1388,"text":"meeting new people,"},{"start":1390,"text":"or even making friends while traveling,"},{"start":1393,"text":"which is a very nerve-racking"},{"start":1396,"text":"experience."},{"start":1397,"text":"But,"},{"start":1399,"text":"I know that with practice,"},{"start":1401,"text":"you'll be ready for it."},{"start":1403,"text":"Thanks so much for watching, guys."},{"start":1405,"text":"And remember,"},{"start":1407,"text":"never stop learning."},{"start":1411,"text":"I'll see you guys next week."},{"start":1413,"text":"Bye."},{"start":1420,"text":"[music]"}]}